  "description": "Keane Mahony Smith are delighted to present to the market this well maintained 1 bedroom first floor apartment located in the popular residential development of Garran Iseal, Doughiska.\n\nSituated within a small and well-established development, the property benefits from ample communal parking, well maintained communal gardens and a private rear garden. The property also has the added benefit of a separate private storage unit, providing useful additional storage.\n\nGarran Iseal is ideally situated to avail of all local amenities & services such as being within walking distance of a number of shopping centres and retail parks which include Dunnes, Lidl and Tesco Express. Both pre-school, primary and secondary level schools are in the locality.\n\nNo 7 is in close proximity to many multi-national employers on the East side of Galway city. Parkmore, Ballybrit and Mervue Industrial developments are home to Boston Scientific, Medtronic and many other medical device and IT companies. The Doughiska area offers quality transport links & bus routes giving frequent access to Galway City & neighbouring suburbs, as well as quick access on to the M6 & M18 motorways.\n\nInternally, the accommodation measuring approximately 50sq.m comprises an entrance hallway with hotpress, bathroom, bedroom, living room and separate kitchen. The property is heated via gas fired central heating and has double glazed windows.\n\nThe property is well maintained throughout and offers an excellent opportunity for an owner occupier or downsizer. The property is also suitable for investors as it is presently owner occupied giving the investor an opportunity to achieve the market rent. \n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nMeasurements\nEntrance Hallway\t1.66 x 2.59 + 1.47 x 1.18\nBathroom\t\t1.35 x 2.34 + 2.52 x 0.92\nBedroom\t\t2.64 x 3.64\nLiving Room\t\t4.62 x 3.70 + 2.08 x 0.50\nKitchen\t\t        1.59 x 2.30 + 2.29 x 1.55",
